Package: tttrlib
Type: Package
Title: Time-Tagged Time-Resolved (TTTR) Photon Data Processing
Version: 0.27.0
Authors@R: person("Thomas-Otavio", "Peulen", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "thomas.otavio.peulen@gmail.com")
Description: R bindings (generated with SWIG) for tttrlib, a C++ library for
    reading, processing and analysing time-tagged time-resolved single-molecule
    and imaging fluorescence spectroscopy data.
License: BSD_3_clause + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
SystemRequirements: C++17, SWIG (>= 4.1), HDF5
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0), methods
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
NeedsCompilation: yes
